                    "value": "<p>60 feet. Any creature in the aura that can see the jack-o'-lantern's lantern staff and is in darkness or dim light must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:28] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fascinated] by the light for 1 minute. Regardless of the result, the creature is then temporarily immune to this aura for 24 hours.</p>"
