                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A jack-o'-lantern whose lantern staff is doused with water or otherwise extinguished takes @Damage[3d6[persistent,mental]] damage, which they automatically recover from when they reignite their lantern. While the flame is snuffed out, the jack-o'-lantern can't use their lantern fire Strike, and their lantern staff Strike doesn't deal fire damage.</p>"
