                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Any creature that accepts or steals the coin from a jack-o'-lantern's purse must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:30] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] for 10 minutes. A creature that fails its save can attempt a new Will save every minute and the first time each round that it takes damage. The jack-o'-lantern can Dismiss this effect.</p>"
